OL,3,GNEWSA'Monster' gym abuser given 18 more
OL,4,Ayears in prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "monster" who used the gym he owned
OL,7,Fto abuse and "degrade" women has been
OL,8,Fsentenced to a further 18 years in
OL,9,Fprison.
OL,11,FDavid Flowers, 43, who owned the
OL,12,FArmoury Gym in Brislington, Bristol, is
OL,13,Falready serving a nearly six-year
OL,14,Fprison sentence for assaulting two
OL,15,Fwomen in 2021.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
