OL,3,GNEWSA'Monster' gym abuser given 18 more
OL,4,Ayears in prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a fresh trial at Bristol Crown Court
OL,7,Fin July, Flowers was convicted of
OL,8,Fmultiple charges including rape,
OL,9,Fassault by penetration, false
OL,10,Fimprisonment and coercive control
OL,11,Fagainst a former partner, and also
OL,12,Fcoercive control of another.
OL,14,FOne victim told the BBC: "He needs to
OL,15,Fstay behind bars for the rest of his
OL,16,Flife because nobody is safe around him;
OL,17,Fhe is a monster and I genuinely think
OL,18,Fhe has the ability to kill someone."
